        "Description": "Welcome to Dubai, 47. Our client is a chocolate company which has recently seen massive success following the &quot;Dubai chocolate&quot; trend. However, a competitor has now arisen and begun to undercut them, stealing their customer base. This rival company is a small start-up, founded by some of the staff of the Burj Al-Ghazali as a second job. You will find the targets at their day job. Happy hunting.",
